## Forward dependencies

Slice 0004 (cooldown unification) will MERGE the in-memory CooldownFSM
into `alert_rule_state.last_fired_at`. The cap counter implemented
here is independent of that consolidation, so no rework is expected
when 0004 lands.

Slice 0007 (Smart Defaults) may add a default `max_fires_per_resolution`
for newly-seeded templates — the schema column already accepts that
without further migration work.

